<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:51:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>我在 2005 年发明了短信餐厅订餐。二十年后，我知道接下来会发生什么</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/online-restaurant-ordering-ecommerce-marketplaces/</link><description>我的技术为 800 多个餐厅品牌提供支持，包括 Shake Shack、Waffle House、Cracker Barrel、Five Guys 和 Panda Express。但我们需要一个新的方向。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glass-e1789002601445.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/online-restaurant-ordering-ecommerce-marketplaces/</guid></item><item><title>SAP Quantum 负责人：AI 即将使智能商品化。更好的决策将是下一个竞争优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/sap-chief-quantum-officer-ai-better-decisions/</link><description>从我的角度来看，我在企业量子工作中反复看到同样的初始瓶颈。它很少访问处理器。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Carsten-Polenz.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/sap-chief-quantum-officer-ai-better-decisions/</guid></item><item><title>Apple 推出首款可折叠智能手机 iPhone Duo，售价 2,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/apple-iphone-18-foldable-launch-event-john-ternus-siri-ai/</link><description>苹果新任首席执行官 John Ternus 发布了多年来最大的 iPhone 更新&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294367943-e1788988946117.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 07:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/apple-iphone-18-foldable-launch-event-john-ternus-siri-ai/</guid></item><item><title>研究人员称，OpenAI 的流氓 AI 代理至少还访问了另外 12 个网站</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/openai-rogue-ai-agents-reached-12-more-websites/</link><description>研究人员表示，OpenAI 代理悄悄地分布在十几个不起眼的网站上，引发了人们对该公司如何监控其系统的疑问。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292626781.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 21:31:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/openai-rogue-ai-agents-reached-12-more-websites/</guid></item><item><title>苹果首款可折叠 iPhone 的 21 张照片</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/20-photos-apple-iphone-duo-2000-dollar-foldable-smartphone/</link><description>Apple 推出了售价 2,000 美元的 iPhone Duo，这是其首款可折叠手机。这是一款外观华丽的设备，像一本书一样打开，露出 7.6 英寸的内部显示屏，前盖上有一个 5.4 英寸的外部屏幕。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-09-at-105809-AM.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 19:43:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/20-photos-apple-iphone-duo-2000-dollar-foldable-smartphone/</guid></item><item><title>Z世代展现“快餐与美食”结合的观影品味，好莱坞“新商业模式”初现端倪</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/hollywood-new-business-model-gen-z-movie-tickets/</link><description>影院售出的门票比 2019 年减少了近 2.49 亿张，但仍创下了 47 亿美元的夏季纪录。现在已经不是 2019 年了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2286155170-e1788986132211.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 20:56:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/hollywood-new-business-model-gen-z-movie-tickets/</guid></item><item><title>尽管西德尼·斯威尼和勒布朗·詹姆斯的广告激起了强烈反对，但预测市场在名人活动上投入巨资</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/prediction-markets-celebrity-campaigns-sydney-sweeney-lebron-james-ads-backlash/</link><description>这些广告引发了对名人将自己的照片借给平台的批评，批评者将其比作赌博。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270322336-e1788986199328.jpg?w=2048" 